{
  "slug": "stream-deck",
  "name": "Stream Deck",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin for building Elgato Stream Deck plugins with the SDK v2.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `add-action` (Add a new action to an existing Stream Deck plugin), `add-property-inspector` (Add a property inspector (settings UI) to a Stream Deck action), `build` (Build, pack, validate, or prepare a Stream Deck plugin for distribution), `create-plugin` (Scaffold a new Stream Deck plugin project from scratch), `dev-mode` (Start Stream Deck plugin development mode with hot-reload, debugging, and live testing), `sdk-reference` (Look up Stream Deck SDK documentation, API reference, manifest schema, events, commands, CLI usage, WebSocket API, property inspector…)\n- **Agents** (1): `stream-deck-dev` (Specialized agent for Stream Deck plugin development)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install stream-deck@claude-community` from `jdsoliveiraa/stream-deck-skill-cc`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
